From af1d67ba9084d9f4959ec0a5f271a55bddbb024a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LNPANDY <lnp-andy@hotmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 19:42:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] hid, games/0400A3A01EE4C000: add virtual Switch 2 Nmouse and
 Pokopia iPhone support

Add host virtual Switch 2 Joy-Con 2 mouse (Nmouse) emulation bridged from Mac mouse and iOS touch/pointer input (DM_VIRTUAL_NMOUSE, 2.5s lift-off, physical Joy-Con 2 priority and detach recovery, teardown reset, DuoHarness runtime stubs, and t_hid_nmouse tests).

Add Pokemon Pokopia (0400A3A01EE4C000) iPhone support: app.entitlements with build_ipa.sh default pickup, KTGL dynamic render-scale stubs with NO_FRAME_STEP and loader.c g_state_page bounds/teardown guard, render_cap support in settings.py, and opt-in iOS --seen-shaders support (ios_seen_shaders, sh/partial-ios isolation, DM_PARTIAL_SHADERS=1).

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Virtual Switch 2 Nmouse input bridge, Pokemon Pokopia iPhone support, and opt-in iOS --seen-shaders fast build
Issue: none
